The 'web-client' folder contains all frontend assets and configuration for the Shattered Archive web application, serving as the user-facing interface that runs in browsers. It includes the main entry point (index.html), React project setup with TypeScript configuration (tsconfig.json), and build tools (vite.config.ts) that handle development server, proxy rules, and production builds. The folder also contains a separate status page (status.html) that provides client monitoring functionality, making it a complete frontend solution for both main application and system status views.
